mits it didn't trace the rename and names no largest author with a share.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Says Ravi and Rowe are active and treats Rowe as one person. It gives no repo-wide share of lines owned by departed people.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Recommends Sam Okafor as a reviewer for time.go.\",\"pass\":false}],\"D\":[{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Says Borman last committed in 2016 and gives no line share. It lists Okafor as a contributor.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Uses commit counts and no percentages. Mei Chen is not credited with the Time7 lines.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Uses commit counts and names Wheeler first. It gives no largest author with a share and mentions Ravi's rename only as a later commit.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Gives no share of lines owned by departed people and says Alex Rowe and Mei Chen are near or outside the window.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Lists Sam Okafor as a contributor and doesn't address Kofi, Noor or the bot commits.\",\"pass\":false}],\"E\":[{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Names Paul Borman with 111 of 152 lines (73%) and says he is probably gone. It hedges on the 'bormanp' identity and says his last commit was about 2021, which is not the 2023 date.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Gives MikeWang 101 of 117 lines, which is 86% and is inside 72-90%. It gives Mei Chen 11 lines and Ravi 2 lines, but doesn't say Ravi committed Mei's lines.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Follows the rename and gives Overfelt 26 lines, with Stone 11, Wheeler 8 and Souza 8, all gone. It says Ravi's commit was only the rename.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Says nobody is active and treats Rowe's identities as split, with no repo-wide percentage of lines owned by departed people. It also recommends Rowe and Mei Chen as reviewers.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Recommends Sam Okafor as a fallback reviewer for time.go.\",\"pass\":false}],\"F\":[{\"n\":1,